      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1052/storytimeline_501052100.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        12,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/12/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4f4e6783fac46e76cf526a45",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我决定相信她，\n先在原地等她一下……",
      "source_fingerprint": "e8ab7d61a8df269c055ab5e40ae2e69b07cfbe122b1eb652e4a47d32c1d4cc73",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1052/storytimeline_501052100.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        13,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/13/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a4c80947dfabd36e11ae1276",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "…………但她完全不回来！\n该不会发生什么事了……\n我急忙跑出去找她！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bb91f8b8e24a0fc65149f275490d1cee95a206acaa257511b4ebdaa9f9965706",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1052/storytimeline_501052100.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        14,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/14/text"
    },
    {
